                  Sugars at 0.1 MPa and Temperatures from (273.2 to 353.2) K', J. Chem. Eng.
                  Data 52 (2007) 40-43, doi 10.1021/je0601816 - CLOSED (Unpaywall is_oa =
                  false; the ACS platform served no abstract, and was under a migration
                  outage), so it is not even confirmed that galactose is one of its six
                  sugars: CONFIRM THAT FIRST, it is a one-line check once the paper is in
                  hand; (b) Uedaira, H.; Uedaira, H., Bull. Chem. Soc. Jpn. 42 (1969)
                  2140-2142, doi 10.1246/bcsj.42.2140 - title verified as 'Diffusion
